Name and credit
---------------

Telltrace was called MVT GUI before version 4.0.3. It is powered by MVT,
the Mobile Verification Toolkit created by Amnesty International's Security
Lab. Telltrace is an independent app: it is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Amnesty International or the MVT project, and "MVT" names only the
toolkit it includes.

